{
 "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab Blog": "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab 博客",
 "GPD trains an RGB-only vision-language model with a teacher that sees question-routed depth, semantic and bird's-eye-view cues. Qwen3-VL-4B: 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on four further spatial benchmarks, ahead of GRPO and answer-privileged OPSD.": "GPD 用一个能看到深度、语义和鸟瞰图线索的教师来训练只输入 RGB 的视觉语言模型，教师拿到哪些线索由问题决定。在 Qwen3-VL-4B 上，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上得到 57.1，在另外四个空间推理评测基准上平均 37.6，高于 GRPO 和只以答案为特权信息的 OPSD。",
 "Use the scene's true geometry as a teacher's privilege during training, and deploy an RGB-only model that has absorbed it.": "训练时把场景的真实几何作为教师的特权信息；部署的模型只看 RGB，但已经吸收了这些几何信息。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>October 20, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Spatial intelligence · Reinforcement learning</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>10 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 10 月 20 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>空间智能 · 强化学习</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>",
 "Vision-language models misjudge depth and direction because RGB frames carry no geometry. GPD hands the scene's true geometry to a teacher during training, only the parts each question needs, and deploys a model that still sees RGB alone.": "RGB 帧里没有几何信息，视觉语言模型因此常把深度和方向判断错。GPD 在训练时把场景的真实几何交给教师，而且只给每个问题用得上的部分；部署后的模型仍然只看 RGB。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University · *Equal contribution †Corresponding author": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 · *同等贡献 †通讯作者",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>错误始于感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 的方法</a>",
 "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D cues as text, routed</a>": "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D 线索写成文本，按问题路由</a>",
 "<a href=\"#distill\">A teacher that corrects mistakes</a>": "<a href=\"#distill\">会纠错的教师</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>哪些因素起作用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>几何信息学进去了吗？</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\">Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\">错误始于感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\">How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\">GPD 的方法</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\">Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\">实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\">What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\">哪些因素起作用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\">Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\">几何信息学进去了吗？</a>",
 "Ask a vision-language model how far the sofa is from the door, or whether the microwave is left or right of the chair, and it often gets the geometry wrong, then reasons fluently from the wrong facts. Training with outcome rewards only tells it the final answer was wrong. Adding 3D encoders or tools fixes the input, but costs architecture changes and inference time.": "问视觉语言模型沙发离门有多远，或者微波炉在椅子的左边还是右边，它经常把几何关系判断错，然后顺着错误的事实流畅地推理下去。只用结果奖励训练，模型只知道最终答案错了。加入 3D 编码器或调用工具可以补全输入，但要改模型结构，推理也更耗时。",
 "GPD (Geometry-Privileged Distillation) uses geometry where it is cheap: in training. Spatial datasets built from 3D scans already contain depth, object semantics and room layout. GPD turns them into short text, keeps only the cues each question needs, and gives them, with the reference answer, to a teacher that is the same model. While GRPO trains on the outcome, the teacher corrects the student's incorrect rollouts token by token. <strong>At deployment the model sees RGB frames and the question, nothing else.</strong>": "GPD（Geometry-Privileged Distillation）把几何信息用在代价最低的地方：训练阶段。由 3D 扫描构建的空间数据集本来就带有深度、物体语义和房间布局。GPD 把这些信息转成简短的文本，只保留每个问题需要的线索，连同参考答案一起交给教师，而教师就是模型自己。GRPO 按结果训练的同时，教师逐 token 纠正学生答错的 rollout。<strong>部署时，模型只看到 RGB 帧和问题，没有任何其他输入。</strong>",
 "<strong>On Qwen3-VL-4B, GPD reaches 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on average over MindCube, SPAR-Bench, MMSI-Bench and ViewSpatial, ahead of both GRPO (56.4 and 35.7) and self-distillation with the answer as the only privilege (55.7 and 31.5).</strong>": "<strong>在 Qwen3-VL-4B 上，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上达到 57.1，在 MindCube、SPAR-Bench、MMSI-Bench 和 ViewSpatial 上平均 37.6，均高于 GRPO（56.4 和 35.7）和只以答案为特权信息的自蒸馏（55.7 和 31.5）。</strong>",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Best of the controlled variants</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube, SPAR, MMSI, ViewSpatial: average</p><p class=\"card-t\">+1.9 over GRPO, +6.1 over OPSD</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">Zero-shot, VSI subset, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Only routed text helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">Gain from adding 3D text at test time</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD needs it less</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">对照方法中最好</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube、SPAR、MMSI、ViewSpatial 平均</p><p class=\"card-t\">比 GRPO 高 1.9，比 OPSD 高 6.1</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">零样本，VSI 子集，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">只有路由后的文本有效</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">测试时加入 3D 文本带来的提升</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD 对它依赖更小</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Spatial errors start in perception": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>空间错误始于感知",
 "Spatial reasoning asks a model to judge distance, direction and layout: plan a route, grasp the nearest object, estimate the size of a room. Two lines of work address it. <strong>Explicit 3D methods</strong> add geometric encoders or call reconstruction and perception tools at test time; they gain geometric evidence but change the architecture and slow inference. <strong>Training-based methods</strong> keep inference RGB-only and fine-tune or reinforce on spatial question answering, but their supervision is the final answer, so a wrong depth order or a flipped left–right relation along the way is never located, let alone corrected.": "空间推理要求模型判断距离、方向和布局，比如规划路线、抓取最近的物体、估计房间面积。现有工作有两条路线。<strong>显式 3D 方法</strong>加入几何编码器，或在测试时调用重建和感知工具，能拿到几何证据，但要改模型结构，推理也更慢。<strong>基于训练的方法</strong>推理时仍只用 RGB，在空间问答数据上做微调或强化学习，但监督信号只有最终答案，推理过程中深度顺序判断错了、左右关系弄反了，都无从定位，更谈不上纠正。",
 "On-policy self-distillation (OPSD) offers token-level supervision: the same model, given privileged context, re-scores the student's own trajectory. Its usual privilege is the reference answer. That cannot fix a spatial error, because the error is perceptual: <strong>a misjudged depth or direction can be corrected only by the scene's true geometry.</strong> And different questions rest on different evidence: counting on semantics, distance on depth, layout on a top-down view.": "On-policy 自蒸馏（OPSD）能提供 token 级监督：同一个模型拿到特权上下文后，给学生自己生成的轨迹重新打分。常用的特权信息是参考答案。但参考答案修正不了空间错误，因为错误出在感知上：<strong>深度或方向判断错了，只有场景的真实几何才能纠正。</strong>而且不同问题依赖的证据不同：计数靠语义，距离靠深度，布局靠俯视图。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 的方法",
 "GPD has two stages. Offline, it builds question-relevant 3D cues for every training example. During training, one VLM plays two roles under two contexts. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> walks through both.": "GPD 分两个阶段。离线阶段，为每条训练样本构建与问题相关的 3D 线索。训练阶段，同一个 VLM 在两种上下文下分别扮演两个角色。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 演示了这两个阶段。",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>Route 3D cues<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>路由 3D 线索<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>Student<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>学生<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>Teacher<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>教师<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>Update<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>更新<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Route 3D cues</b><span>offline, per question</span>": "<b>路由 3D 线索</b><span>离线完成，逐题处理</span>",
 "<b>Student</b><span>RGB frames + question only</span>": "<b>学生</b><span>只输入 RGB 帧和问题</span>",
 "“Near the bed, looking at the chair: is the microwave on the chair’s left or right?”": "“站在床边看向椅子：微波炉在椅子的左边还是右边？”",
 "GRPO scores every rollout by its answer. Rollouts with reward <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 go to the teacher.": "GRPO 根据答案给每个 rollout 打分，奖励 <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 的 rollout 交给教师。",
 "<b>Teacher</b><span>same weights + routed 3D cues + answer</span>": "<b>教师</b><span>同一套权重 + 路由后的 3D 线索 + 答案</span>",
 "<span>student: <b>A. Right</b></span><span>reference: <b>B. Left</b></span>": "<span>学生：<b>A. 右边</b></span><span>参考答案：<b>B. 左边</b></span>",
 "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>teacher agrees</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>teacher disagrees</span>": "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>教师认同</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>教师不认同</span>",
 "<b>Update, then deploy</b><span>one set of weights</span>": "<b>更新，然后部署</b><span>始终只有一套权重</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub> on incorrect rollouts, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003": "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub>（仅错误 rollout）, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003",
 "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB frames</span><span class=\"m4-in\">question</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD model</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">answer</span>": "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB 帧</span><span class=\"m4-in\">问题</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD 模型</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">答案</span>",
 "No depth, segmentation or layout at test time: the geometry lives in the weights.": "测试时不需要深度、分割或布局信息：几何知识已经在权重里了。",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> GPD in four steps. <b>Route:</b> the base VLM chooses which cues each question needs, following the paper's routing analysis (counting uses semantics; absolute distance uses depth; room size uses the top-down view; relative direction uses semantics and the top-down view); the privilege block is the paper's example. <b>Student:</b> the model samples a group of answers from RGB alone (rewards here are illustrative). <b>Teacher:</b> the same model, given the routed cues and the answer, re-scores an incorrect rollout token by token; the example and its shading follow the paper's Figure 3. <b>Update:</b> GRPO plus the gated distillation loss; the deployed model is RGB-only.": "<b>图 1</b> GPD 的四个步骤。<b>路由：</b>基座 VLM 判断每个问题需要哪些线索，图中的路由结果依据论文的路由分析（计数用语义；绝对距离用深度；房间面积用俯视图；相对方向用语义和俯视图）；特权信息块取自论文中的示例。<b>学生：</b>模型只根据 RGB 采样一组答案（图中的奖励仅作示意）。<b>教师：</b>同一个模型拿到路由后的线索和答案，逐 token 给一条错误 rollout 重新打分；示例和着色参照论文图 3。<b>更新：</b>GRPO 损失加上带门控的蒸馏损失；部署的模型只用 RGB。",
 "3D cues as text, routed per question": "把 3D 线索写成文本，按问题路由",
 "For every training example, GPD builds up to three cues once, offline. Where a dataset comes from 3D scans, as VSI and SPAR do from ScanNet, the cues come straight from the annotations; otherwise depth is estimated with Depth Anything 3 and objects with Grounded-SAM-2. A fixed template turns each cue into a few lines of text: <strong>depth</strong> lists objects from near to far with distances, <strong>semantics</strong> lists objects with their image regions, and the <strong>bird’s-eye view</strong> gives top-down positions relative to the camera.": "GPD 离线为每条训练样本构建最多三种线索，只需构建一次。如果数据集来自 3D 扫描（如 VSI 和 SPAR 都来自 ScanNet），线索直接从标注中得到；否则用 Depth Anything 3 估计深度，用 Grounded-SAM-2 识别物体。每种线索用固定模板写成几行文本：<strong>深度</strong>按由近到远列出物体及距离，<strong>语义</strong>列出物体及其所在的图像区域，<strong>鸟瞰图</strong>给出物体相对相机的俯视位置。",
 "Not every question needs every cue, and injecting all of them dilutes the teacher's signal. The base VLM therefore picks the relevant subset for each question, offline. The routes it picks are intuitive: counting goes entirely to semantics, absolute distance mostly to depth, room size mostly to the top-down view, and relative direction to semantics plus the top-down view.": "并非每个问题都需要全部线索，全部注入反而会稀释教师的信号。因此，由基座 VLM 离线为每个问题挑选相关的线索子集。它的选择很符合直觉：计数全部选语义，绝对距离主要选深度，房间面积主要选俯视图，相对方向选语义加俯视图。",
 "Text turns out to be the right form for this privilege. In a zero-shot test before any training, given to Qwen3-VL-4B without the answer, <strong>routed text is the only form of 3D input that beats RGB alone</strong> (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a>).": "这类特权信息最适合用文本表示。训练前先做零样本测试：不给答案，把不同形式的 3D 信息交给 Qwen3-VL-4B，<strong>只有路由后的文本超过了只用 RGB 的结果</strong>（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a>）。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, zero-shot, 1,000 VSI-590K questions, no reference answer": "Qwen3-VL-4B，零样本，1,000 道 VSI-590K 问题，不给参考答案",
 "Accuracy with different forms of 3D input (%)": "不同形式 3D 输入下的准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> The same RGB frames plus 3D cues given as rendered images or as text, either all cues or only the routed ones (paper Figure 5, left). The dashed line is RGB only; the axis starts at 40.": "<b>图 2</b> 在相同的 RGB 帧之外，以渲染图像或文本形式加入 3D 线索，分为全部线索和仅路由线索两种（论文图 5 左）。虚线为只用 RGB 的结果；坐标轴从 40 开始。",
 "A teacher that corrects mistakes": "会纠错的教师",
 "During training, the student sees <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, question) and samples a group of eight answers; GRPO turns their rewards into advantages. The teacher is the same network given <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, question, routed cues, answer). For each token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> the student sampled, GPD compares the two log-probabilities, Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>), and uses <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 as a cheap estimate of the reverse KL.": "训练时，学生的输入是 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题)，采样一组 8 个答案，GRPO 把它们的奖励换算成优势。教师是同一个网络，输入为 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题, 路由线索, 答案)。对学生采样出的每个 token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span>，GPD 比较两个对数概率 Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>)，并用 <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 作为反向 KL 的低成本估计。",
 "Two choices keep this signal clean. <strong>It applies only to incorrect rollouts</strong> (reward below 0.5): on correct ones the teacher can only add noise. And the averaged loss is <strong>clipped at 1.5</strong>, then added to GRPO with weight λ = 0.003. The teacher thereby shapes the student's own reasoning, along its own trajectory, rather than asking it to imitate text the teacher wrote.": "有两处设计让这个信号保持干净。<strong>它只作用于错误的 rollout</strong>（奖励低于 0.5）：在正确的 rollout 上，教师只会引入噪声。平均后的损失<strong>截断在 1.5</strong>，再以权重 λ = 0.003 加到 GRPO 损失上。这样，教师沿着学生自己的轨迹修正学生自己的推理，而不是让学生去模仿教师写出的文本。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Results": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果",
 "We train Qwen3-VL-Instruct at 2B and 4B for one epoch on 10K VSI, 4K SPAR and 1K MindCube questions, and compare with GRPO and with OPSD that uses the reference answer as its only privilege, all on the same data, backbone and settings.": "我们在 10K 条 VSI、4K 条 SPAR 和 1K 条 MindCube 问题上训练 2B 和 4B 两个规模的 Qwen3-VL-Instruct，训练 1 个 epoch，并与 GRPO 以及只以参考答案为特权信息的 OPSD 对比。三种方法使用相同的数据、骨干模型和设置。",
 "Controlled comparison, same data and backbone": "对照比较，数据和骨干模型相同",
 "VSI-Bench, average accuracy": "VSI-Bench，平均准确率",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Base model, GRPO, answer-privileged OPSD and GPD on five spatial benchmarks (paper Tables 1 and 2). “Average of four” is the mean over MindCube, SPAR, MMSI and ViewSpatial. GPD has the best average on both scales, though not on every benchmark: OPSD leads on ViewSpatial at 4B, and GRPO on SPAR at 2B.": "<b>图 3</b> 基座模型、GRPO、以答案为特权信息的 OPSD 和 GPD 在五个空间推理评测基准上的结果（论文表 1 和表 2）。“四项平均”指 MindCube、SPAR、MMSI 和 ViewSpatial 的均值。GPD 在两个规模上的平均分都最高，但并非每个基准都最好：4B 时 OPSD 在 ViewSpatial 上领先，2B 时 GRPO 在 SPAR 上领先。",
 "<strong>On VSI-Bench</strong>, GPD-4B reaches 57.1, 1.7 points above the base model, 0.7 above GRPO and 1.4 above OPSD, with its gains on geometry-heavy subtasks such as relative distance and direction. <strong>On the four other benchmarks</strong> it averages 37.6, 1.9 points above GRPO and 6.1 above OPSD, with the largest gain on MindCube (38.0 against 33.0 for GRPO). The 2B model shows the same ordering on both averages (51.7 and 33.6). Answer-only OPSD often falls below GRPO, a reminder that an answer alone does not say where the reasoning went wrong.": "<strong>在 VSI-Bench 上</strong>，GPD-4B 达到 57.1，比基座模型高 1.7 分，比 GRPO 高 0.7，比 OPSD 高 1.4，提升集中在相对距离、相对方向等依赖几何的子任务上。<strong>在另外四个基准上</strong>，GPD-4B 平均 37.6，比 GRPO 高 1.9，比 OPSD 高 6.1，其中 MindCube 提升最大（38.0，GRPO 为 33.0）。2B 模型在两组平均分上的排序相同（51.7 和 33.6）。只用答案的 OPSD 常常不如 GRPO，可见单凭答案无法指出推理在哪一步出了错。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>哪些因素起作用",
 "We ablate on Qwen3-VL-4B, averaging over all five benchmarks. <strong>The answer and the geometry are complementary:</strong> adding the reference answer alone gives 40.2, routed 3D text alone 40.5, and both together 41.5, against 39.8 for GRPO. <strong>Routing beats more context:</strong> injecting all 3D text, with the answer, falls to 39.8, the same as GRPO, and routed cues rendered as images reach 40.4. <strong>The weight matters, and so does the gate:</strong> λ = 0.003 is best, and applying the teacher to every rollout instead of only incorrect ones costs 0.9 points.": "我们在 Qwen3-VL-4B 上做消融，指标取五个基准的平均分。<strong>答案和几何信息互补：</strong>只加参考答案得到 40.2，只加路由后的 3D 文本得到 40.5，两者都加得到 41.5，GRPO 为 39.8。<strong>路由比堆上下文更有效：</strong>带答案注入全部 3D 文本会降到 39.8，与 GRPO 持平；把路由线索渲染成图像得到 40.4。<strong>权重和门控都有影响：</strong>λ = 0.003 最好；如果教师作用于所有 rollout 而不只是错误的 rollout，会损失 0.9 分。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, average of five benchmarks": "Qwen3-VL-4B，五个基准平均",
 "Which privilege, in which form": "特权信息的内容与形式",
 "Same setting": "设置相同",
 "Distillation weight λ and scope": "蒸馏权重 λ 与作用范围",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> <b>Left:</b> privilege ablation (paper Figure 4, left). Base and OPSD are averaged from the per-benchmark tables. <b>Right:</b> the distillation weight with incorrect-only gating, against GRPO (dashed) and the all-rollouts variant at λ = 0.003 (paper Figure 4, right; values reported in the text).": "<b>图 4</b> <b>左：</b>特权信息消融（论文图 4 左）。基座模型和 OPSD 的数值由各基准的表格结果求平均得到。<b>右：</b>只在错误 rollout 上蒸馏时不同蒸馏权重的结果，对照为 GRPO（虚线）和 λ = 0.003 时作用于全部 rollout 的变体（论文图 4 右；数值取自正文）。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>几何信息学进去了吗？",
 "If GPD internalizes the cues, giving them back at test time should help it less. That is what happens (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>): with RGB alone, GPD scores 56.3 against 54.9 for GRPO; adding routed 3D text at test time lifts GRPO by 2.1 points but GPD by only 0.6.": "如果 GPD 内化了这些线索，测试时再把线索给它，帮助应该更小。结果正是如此（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>）：只用 RGB 时，GPD 得 56.3，GRPO 得 54.9；测试时加入路由后的 3D 文本，GRPO 提升 2.1 分，GPD 只提升 0.6 分。",
 "Accuracy with RGB only, and with routed 3D text added at test time": "只用 RGB，以及测试时加入路由 3D 文本后的准确率",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Test-time dependence on 3D privilege (paper Figure 7; the axis starts at 50). The smaller gap for GPD suggests the geometric cues were absorbed during training.": "<b>图 5</b> 测试时对 3D 特权信息的依赖（论文图 7；坐标轴从 50 开始）。GPD 的差距更小，表明它在训练中已经吸收了几何线索。",
 "The training curves agree. Validation accuracy is similar early on, then GPD keeps improving while GRPO plateaus; GPD's policy entropy peaks higher and earlier, a sign that the teacher's signal broadens exploration before the two settle. In the paper's case study, a four-view question about walking toward a stone fountain, GPD localizes the camera, maps the turn into the scene's frame and finds the fountain across views, while GRPO places the fountain on the wrong side of a jar and answers wrongly.": "训练曲线也说明了这一点。验证准确率起初相近，之后 GRPO 进入平台期，GPD 继续上升；GPD 的策略熵峰值更高、出现更早，说明在两者趋于稳定之前，教师信号扩大了探索范围。论文的案例分析中有一道四视角问题，问的是朝一座石制喷泉走去的情形：GPD 先定位相机，把转向映射到场景坐标系中，再在多个视角里找到喷泉；GRPO 则把喷泉放到了罐子错误的一侧，答错了。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path leaves a torn paper cube, bends at a node and reaches a flat sheet, on which a faint outline of the cube appears": "动画：一道墨迹从撕破的纸立方体出发，在一个节点处转折，落到一张平整的纸上，纸面上浮现出立方体的淡淡轮廓",
 "Backbone": "骨干模型",
 "Benchmark": "评测基准"
}